    "detailed_description": "<h1>Live streaming and postings on Youtube, Twitch, and SNS.</h1><p>Please see the Steam discussion boards page.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Drive a Kei Truck through a collapsing Japan! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are being chased by aliens! Dodge attacks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/8b65c3036bbbd7ecb688a64f988676fa.poster.avif?t=1753749349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/8b65c3036bbbd7ecb688a64f988676fa.webm?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/8b65c3036bbbd7ecb688a64f988676fa.mp4?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dodge attacks with wall-riding!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It is very dangerous to actually run in this way, so please do not imitate it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/30f8dd9481c0ed3e3a9b110a38ae8eec.poster.avif?t=1753749349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/30f8dd9481c0ed3e3a9b110a38ae8eec.webm?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/30f8dd9481c0ed3e3a9b110a38ae8eec.mp4?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Recover the nitro by destruction!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I don't know why nitro is recovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/db15a961c7943af28d7ef7d8d5c812a6.poster.avif?t=1753749349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/db15a961c7943af28d7ef7d8d5c812a6.webm?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/db15a961c7943af28d7ef7d8d5c812a6.mp4?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Counterattack on enemies!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/45b27cc69369651253bdf6a25c9f933c.poster.avif?t=1753749349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/45b27cc69369651253bdf6a25c9f933c.webm?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/45b27cc69369651253bdf6a25c9f933c.mp4?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle with giant creatures!  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/31d72bf48791e8ba9b4ce87f9fe29f13.poster.avif?t=1753749349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/31d72bf48791e8ba9b4ce87f9fe29f13.webm?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/31d72bf48791e8ba9b4ce87f9fe29f13.mp4?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game progression is based on a stage-by-stage system.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are stages where smaller enemies appear and stages where you fight giant bosses. There are stages where no enemies appear. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Compete with other players on online leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game implements online leaderboards, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">where scores and times are recorded for each stage so that you can compete with other players.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Drive a Kei Truck through a collapsing Japan! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are being chased by aliens! Dodge attacks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/8b65c3036bbbd7ecb688a64f988676fa.poster.avif?t=1753749349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/8b65c3036bbbd7ecb688a64f988676fa.webm?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/8b65c3036bbbd7ecb688a64f988676fa.mp4?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dodge attacks with wall-riding!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It is very dangerous to actually run in this way, so please do not imitate it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/30f8dd9481c0ed3e3a9b110a38ae8eec.poster.avif?t=1753749349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/30f8dd9481c0ed3e3a9b110a38ae8eec.webm?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/30f8dd9481c0ed3e3a9b110a38ae8eec.mp4?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Recover the nitro by destruction!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I don't know why nitro is recovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/db15a961c7943af28d7ef7d8d5c812a6.poster.avif?t=1753749349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/db15a961c7943af28d7ef7d8d5c812a6.webm?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/db15a961c7943af28d7ef7d8d5c812a6.mp4?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Counterattack on enemies!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/45b27cc69369651253bdf6a25c9f933c.poster.avif?t=1753749349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/45b27cc69369651253bdf6a25c9f933c.webm?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/45b27cc69369651253bdf6a25c9f933c.mp4?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle with giant creatures!  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/31d72bf48791e8ba9b4ce87f9fe29f13.poster.avif?t=1753749349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/31d72bf48791e8ba9b4ce87f9fe29f13.webm?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/31d72bf48791e8ba9b4ce87f9fe29f13.mp4?t=1753749349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game progression is based on a stage-by-stage system.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are stages where smaller enemies appear and stages where you fight giant bosses. There are stages where no enemies appear. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Compete with other players on online leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game implements online leaderboards, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">where scores and times are recorded for each stage so that you can compete with other players.</p>",
